OL,3,ATexas death-row inmate screams as      
OL,4,Aexecution takes more than one hour     
OL,6,FA US death row inmate has screamed in  
OL,7,Fapparent pain during his Texas         
OL,8,Fexecution which lasted more than an    
OL,9,Fhour.                                  
OL,11,FThis is "not working the way it should 
OL,12,Fbe," Reinaldo Dennes, 70, said as he   
OL,13,Fwas being injected with the drug       
OL,14,Fpentobarbital, according to witnesses. 
OL,16,FA spokeswoman for the Texas Department 
OL,17,Fof Criminal Justice said there had been
OL,18,Funsuccessful attempts to find veins for
OL,19,Fthe injections, but added that Dennes  
OL,20,Fhad reported pain in parts of his body 
OL,21,Fwhere there were no attempted          
OL,22,Finjections.                            
