OL,3,ATexas death-row inmate screams as      
OL,4,Aexecution takes more than one hour     
OL,6,FDennes's case comes weeks after the    
OL,7,Fbotched execution of Christa Pike, who 
OL,8,Fsurvived two lethal doses and is       
OL,9,Fbelieved to be the only individual to  
OL,10,Fhave survived an execution attempt by  
OL,11,Flethal injection.                      
